    "body": "```suggestion\nThe authorizing capability for memory accesses is <<ddc>> (as opposed to `rs1`).\nThat is, all memory accesses, including <<PREFETCH_W_CHERI>> and <<PREFETCH_R_CHERI>>, are implicitly authorized by <<ddc>> and only the memory address is sourced from `rs1`.\nThe exception to this rule are jumps and <<PREFETCH_I_CHERI>>, which are authorized by <<pcc>> instead.\n```\nMaybe call out jumps as well?",
